# Core Module

> **A01 Blockchain Intelligence Agent**
>
> The **Core Module** is the execution engine of the A01 agent.
> It coordinates the complete lifecycle of the autonomous blockchain agent,
> including task execution, reasoning, tool orchestration, event handling,
> runtime management, guardrails, and lifecycle control.

---

# Purpose

The Core package provides the foundation for every higher-level module inside
the A01 agent.

It is responsible for:

- Agent lifecycle management
- Runtime initialization
- Task orchestration
- Tool execution
- Context propagation
- Event processing
- Permission enforcement
- Runtime safety
- Retry logic
- Scheduling
- Agent coordination

Every module such as Memory, Contracts, State Manager, AI Reasoning,
and Blockchain Services interacts with the Core package.

---

# High-Level Architecture

```
                User Request
                      │
                      ▼
              Agent Runtime
                      │
        ┌─────────────┼─────────────┐
        │             │             │
        ▼             ▼             ▼
   Lifecycle      Context      Event Bus
        │             │             │
        └──────┬──────┴──────┬──────┘
               ▼
        Agent Orchestrator
               │
      ┌────────┼────────┐
      ▼        ▼        ▼
  Tool Router Scheduler Guardrails
      │        │        │
      ▼        ▼        ▼
 Execution Queue Runtime State
               │
               ▼
        External Services
```

---

# Responsibilities

The Core package is responsible for:

- bootstrapping the agent
- coordinating execution
- routing tools
- scheduling jobs
- runtime management
- context propagation
- event dispatching
- enforcing security policies
- retry handling
- graceful shutdown

---

