# Future Extensions

The architecture is designed to support:

- Multi-agent execution
- Distributed workers
- Remote execution
- Kubernetes deployment
- Plugin marketplace
- AI planning engine
- Autonomous workflows
- Human approval workflows
- Multi-chain orchestration
- Cross-agent communication

---

# Development Rules

Every Core component must:

- be fully typed
- support async execution
- avoid circular dependencies
- use structured logging
- raise explicit exceptions
- expose clean public APIs
- remain independently testable

---

# Related Modules

```
config/
memory/
contracts/
state_manager/
schemas/
```

The Core module coordinates these packages but remains independent of their internal implementations through well-defined interfaces.

